# De xuat mo rong database

Tai lieu nay mo ta schema database mong muon cho he thong dang ky va check-in su kien.
So voi schema hien tai, ban de xuat them quan tri vien va su kien rieng biet, de ung dung co the quan ly nhieu su kien thay vi chi mot dot check-in.

## Tong quan cac bang

| Bang | Muc dich |
| --- | --- |
| `admins` | Luu tai khoan quan tri va phan quyen |
| `users` | Luu thong tin CB/SV hoac nguoi tham gia |
| `events` | Luu thong tin tung su kien |
| `registrations` | Luu nguoi da dang ky tham gia su kien |
| `checkins` | Luu lich su check-in cua nguoi tham gia |

