## 1. `admins`

Luu tai khoan quan tri. Bang nay dung de dang nhap vao khu vuc admin, tao su kien va tao them admin phu.

| Cot | Rang buoc | Ghi chu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | Primary key | Ma dinh danh admin |
| `username` | Unique | Ten dang nhap, khong duoc trung |
| `password_hash` | Not null | Mat khau da bam, khong luu mat khau goc |
| `ho_ten` |  | Ho ten quan tri vien |
| `email` |  | Email lien he |
| `role` |  | Gia tri nen gom `super_admin`, `admin` |
| `is_active` |  | `true` neu con hoat dong, `false` neu bi khoa |
| `created_by` | Foreign key -> `admins.id` | Admin nao da tao tai khoan nay |
| `created_at` |  | Thoi diem tao tai khoan |

Quan he:

- Mot admin co the tao nhieu su kien.
- Mot admin co the tao nhieu admin phu.
- `created_by` tro ve chinh bang `admins`, nen day la quan he tu tham chieu.

## 2. `users`

Luu thong tin CB/SV hoac nguoi tham gia su kien.

| Cot | Rang buoc | Ghi chu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ma_cbsv` | Primary key | Ma CB/SV, dung lam dinh danh chinh |
| `ho_ten` |  | Ho ten nguoi tham gia |
| `don_vi` |  | Khoa, phong ban, don vi |
| `chuc_vu` |  | Sinh vien, giang vien, chuyen vien... |
| `so_dien_thoai` |  | So dien thoai |
| `email` |  | Email nhan thong bao |

Quan he:

- Mot user co the dang ky nhieu su kien.
- Mot user co the check-in nhieu su kien.

## 3. `events`

Luu thong tin tung su kien. Bang nay giup he thong quan ly nhieu su kien theo thang, nam, thoi gian mo/dong dang ky va so luong gioi han.

| Cot | Rang buoc | Ghi chu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | Primary key | Ma dinh danh su kien |
| `ten_su_kien` |  | Ten su kien |
| `mo_ta` |  | Mo ta noi dung su kien |
| `dia_diem` |  | Dia diem to chuc |
| `ngay_bat_dau` |  | Thoi gian bat dau su kien |
| `ngay_ket_thuc` |  | Thoi gian ket thuc su kien |
| `thang` |  | Thang cua su kien, ho tro loc/thong ke |
| `nam` |  | Nam cua su kien, ho tro loc/thong ke |
| `thoi_gian_mo_dang_ky` |  | Thoi diem bat dau cho dang ky |
| `thoi_gian_dong_dang_ky` |  | Thoi diem dung nhan dang ky |
| `so_luong_toi_da` |  | Gioi han so nguoi dang ky |
| `trang_thai` |  | Gia tri nen gom `upcoming`, `ongoing`, `closed` |
| `created_by` | Foreign key -> `admins.id` | Admin tao su kien |
| `created_at` |  | Thoi diem tao su kien |

Quan he:

- Mot event co nhieu registrations.
- Mot event co nhieu checkins.
- Mot event duoc tao boi mot admin.

## 4. `registrations`

Luu danh sach nguoi da dang ky tham gia tung su kien.

| Cot | Rang buoc | Ghi chu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | Primary key | Ma dinh danh lan dang ky |
| `ma_cbsv` | Foreign key -> `users.ma_cbsv` | Nguoi dang ky |
| `event_id` | Foreign key -> `events.id` | Su kien duoc dang ky |
| `thoi_gian_dang_ky` |  | Thoi diem dang ky |

Rang buoc nen co:

```sql
UNIQUE (ma_cbsv, event_id)
```

Y nghia: mot nguoi chi duoc dang ky mot lan cho cung mot su kien.

## 5. `checkins`

Luu lich su check-in cua nguoi tham gia theo tung su kien.

| Cot | Rang buoc | Ghi chu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | Primary key | Ma dinh danh lan check-in |
| `ma_cbsv` | Foreign key -> `users.ma_cbsv` | Nguoi check-in |
| `event_id` | Foreign key -> `events.id` | Su kien duoc check-in |
| `thoi_gian_checkin` |  | Thoi diem check-in |

Rang buoc nen co:

```sql
UNIQUE (ma_cbsv, event_id)
```

Y nghia: mot nguoi chi duoc check-in mot lan cho cung mot su kien.

## Tom tat luong du lieu

1. `super_admin` tao tai khoan admin trong bang `admins`.
2. Admin tao su kien trong bang `events`.
3. Nguoi tham gia nam trong bang `users`.
4. Khi user dang ky su kien, he thong tao record trong `registrations`.
5. Khi user check-in su kien, he thong tao record trong `checkins`.

## Danh sach foreign key

| Foreign key | Tham chieu den | Y nghia |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `admins.created_by` | `admins.id` | Admin tao admin khac |
| `events.created_by` | `admins.id` | Admin tao su kien |
| `registrations.ma_cbsv` | `users.ma_cbsv` | Nguoi dang ky |
| `registrations.event_id` | `events.id` | Su kien duoc dang ky |
| `checkins.ma_cbsv` | `users.ma_cbsv` | Nguoi check-in |
| `checkins.event_id` | `events.id` | Su kien duoc check-in |

## Ghi chu quan trong

- Nen dung `password_hash`, khong bao gio luu mat khau dang text thuong.
- Nen dat `users.ma_cbsv` lam primary key neu ma CB/SV la dinh danh duy nhat va on dinh.
- Nen them unique constraint cho `registrations(ma_cbsv, event_id)` de chan dang ky trung o tang database.
- Nen them unique constraint cho `checkins(ma_cbsv, event_id)` de chan check-in trung o tang database.
- Neu mot su kien cho phep check-in nhieu buoi hoac nhieu ngay, nen them bang/bien the `event_sessions` thay vi chi unique theo `event_id`.
